codex
I found the environment-specific cause: this sandbox exposes `/proc/self/exe` but hides `/proc/<current-pid>/exe`, while Lean 4.22’s `IO.appPath` uses the latter. I’m applying a narrowly scoped preload shim that redirects only that exact self-executable lookup; it does not alter Lean sources, candidate sources, theorem checking, or proof behavior. Both failed attempts remain recorded.
apply patch
